I've been playing Nethack3 for a few days now, and on the whole I'm
quite impressed ! There is one thing though which really annoys me:
there seem to be three commands (jump, loot and untrap) which, according
to the online help are only available if the number_pad option is set.
This is rather annoying. Why can't they be made available on some other
keys as well (as in the kick and name commands) ?

Maybe I've missed something obvious, and it can be done, but if not,
could something be done in the next release ?

